Coordination and Reportorial Requirements. The government agencies
and instrumentalities as earlier enumerated, shall submit their GAD Plan to NCRFW for
review and endorsement to the Department of Budget and Management (DBM);
They shall likewise submit their annual reports on the implementation of the GAD
Plan to the DBM, Congress, and the NCRFW indicating the accomplishments and
amounts utilized/disbursed for the projects and programs;
